    "detailed_description": "<strong>Apartment 606</strong> is a suspenseful horror and management game where survival hinges on more than just evading danger, you must also complete critical tasks to keep your job while managing unexpected challenges. Each night introduces new threats as you balance your work responsibilities with the growing terror around you. Spanning five nights, the game features cinematic sequences and story progression that slowly reveal the mystery behind your situation. The entire game takes place within the apartment, with multiple possible endings based on your choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/0d7dd72a7e1c49e57af26d494e3762f7.poster.avif?t=1727187380\" width=624 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/0d7dd72a7e1c49e57af26d494e3762f7.webm?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/0d7dd72a7e1c49e57af26d494e3762f7.mp4?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview:</h2><br><strong>Computer Mechanics: Don\u2019t Get Fired, Work Every Night!</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tasks:</strong> To meet your daily quota, you can perform four different tasks on the computer: writing emails, filling out calculation sheets, solving company captchas, and transferring files.<br></li><li><strong>Shop:</strong> Earn extra money beyond your quota? Spend it on various upgrades to help you survive the night, such as better internet or a UPS battery for your computer.<br></li><li><strong>Mail:</strong> As a full-time employee, you\u2019ll receive mail each night. Some are helpful, while others are just spam. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/91dc28abb81617078acfac435a5099e5.poster.avif?t=1727187380\" width=624 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/91dc28abb81617078acfac435a5099e5.webm?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/91dc28abb81617078acfac435a5099e5.mp4?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Event Mechanics: Keep Your Apartment Safe!</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Camera System:</strong> After certain events, you\u2019ll gain access to a full camera system. However, the cameras are unreliable and often require rebooting.<br></li><li><strong>Sound Management:</strong> There\u2019s a lot of noise in the apartment, to avoid complaints (or worse), make sure to keep the radio, TV, and other sound devices off.<br></li><li><strong>Light Management:</strong> Construction in your building frequently causes the fuse box to trip. Keep the lights on, as darkness may invite sinister characters.<br></li><li><strong>Locking Feature:</strong> There\u2019s a lock on your door and balcony, make sure both are secured before you head to bed.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/aeb0ae9bd9712679dce7f60e5381b134.poster.avif?t=1727187380\" width=624 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/aeb0ae9bd9712679dce7f60e5381b134.webm?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/aeb0ae9bd9712679dce7f60e5381b134.mp4?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Survival Horror:</strong> Experience the tension and dread of being alone in a dark, mysterious apartment. Each night grows more dangerous as the environment becomes increasingly hostile.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic Night Progression:</strong> Over the five nights, the difficulty escalates as new challenges and threats emerge, requiring adaptability and vigilance.<br></li><li><strong>Weather Changes:</strong> Random weather changes between nights can increase the difficulty.<br></li><li><strong>PC-Based Tasks:</strong> Over five intense nights, your primary goal is to complete work-related tasks on the computer while managing household checklists\u2014all of which are vital for your safety and survival.<br></li><li><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your decisions throughout the game lead to different outcomes, adding replay value.<br></li><li><strong>Secret Ending:</strong> There\u2019s one hidden ending, can you find the clues ?<br></li><li><strong>Extra Night:</strong> After completing the game, you unlock a challenging sixth night. This 20-minute endurance test grows harder every second. Survive, and you\u2019ll unlock two additional endings.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/acc9a92b10e90d0f96f0567f79767445.poster.avif?t=1727187380\" width=624 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/acc9a92b10e90d0f96f0567f79767445.webm?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161050/extras/acc9a92b10e90d0f96f0567f79767445.mp4?t=1727187380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Can you survive the five nights and uncover the truth behind the looming threat? Or will the false comfort of safety be your undoing?",
